{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a mysterious city submerged in a dense Mist, abandoned by humans and ruled by different clans of stray animals. <strong>Activate your feline instinct</strong>, using the\u00a0<strong>stealth</strong>, <strong>agility</strong>, and <strong>curiosity</strong> of a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/efe6e83cd83cc1551c3147b897668175.poster.avif?t=1761664639\" width=502 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/efe6e83cd83cc1551c3147b897668175.webm?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/efe6e83cd83cc1551c3147b897668175.mp4?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> a beautiful adventure full of  magical realism, where the <strong>past blends with the present</strong>. You'll explore places from the past, interact with old friends, and find the pieces of a <strong>hidden story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/55820767e54c4c66d0eed7f63a9d3715.poster.avif?t=1761664639\" width=546 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/55820767e54c4c66d0eed7f63a9d3715.webm?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/55820767e54c4c66d0eed7f63a9d3715.mp4?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the dangers that lurk behind the Mist... you are not alone on this journey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/69ee1db5b85fdbef031a88375783ec6b.poster.avif?t=1761664639\" width=502 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/69ee1db5b85fdbef031a88375783ec6b.webm?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/69ee1db5b85fdbef031a88375783ec6b.mp4?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most of all... Immerse yourself in a <strong>cat's journey in search of her elderly friend</strong>, a story of friendship in a world of confusion and oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/3aad7f19c3d180eb36cd8208bbbe8fe3.poster.avif?t=1761664639\" width=502 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/3aad7f19c3d180eb36cd8208bbbe8fe3.webm?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/extras/3aad7f19c3d180eb36cd8208bbbe8fe3.mp4?t=1761664639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700100?t=1761664639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/7456f39cfe7b996499652fff9a871bcefa19d26f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761664639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700100/3c4883bda85b574884cca1b5f71c1c178cbc8f01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761664639","capsule_imagev5":"https://s